> Genuine original CAD surfaces,not abstract geometric stand-ins

Use official ModelNet10.zip,473402300bytes,SHA256
9d8679435fc07d1d26f13009878db164a7aa8ea5e7ea3c8880e42794b7307d51.
Classes0/1/2 are chair/sofa/table. Per class,lexical first8official training
meshes fit,next2validate,and first4official test meshes test:24/6/12objects.
Original OFF bytes/member names/hashes remain local. Object IDs are disjoint;
near-duplicate CAD shapes across original records are not certified absent.

