> Identity T-Nets and all nine penalty derivatives

Both PointNet transform heads use zero weights/bias plus identity,so their
initial matrices are exactlyI. Upstream T-Net gradients initially vanish until
the final transform head moves;pre-BN biases can also have zero adjoints.
Connected finite gradients are the structural check,not a demand that all
initial adjoints be nonzero. During fitting,the caller adds the feature-transform
penalty .0005*sum((AA^T-I)^2) to mean categorical CE. It sums across the batch,
matching the source;it does not project the transform or hide an optimizer.

A declared nonorthogonal3x3fixture exposes the penalty and every entry's
adjoint. Orthogonal rotation and identity have exactly zero penalty. The
native suite independently checks all nine entries against literal host algebra.
```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/point_models_checks_penalty.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;
  auto transform = n::tensor({1.1, .2, -.1, .05, .9, .15, 0., -.1, 1.05}, {1, 3, 3});
  transform.requires_grad_(true);
  const auto loss = m::PointTransformPenalty(transform, 3);
  const auto gradient = n::grad(loss, {transform})[0];
  const auto rotation = n::tensor({0., -1., 0., 1., 0., 0., 0., 0., 1.}, {1, 3, 3});
  const auto orthogonal = m::PointTransformPenalty(rotation, 3);
  if (orthogonal.item() != 0)
    return 1;
  std::print("Declared nonorthogonal penalty {:.9g};all9entry adjoints {};orthogonal rotation "
             "penalty {:.3g}.\n",
             loss.item(), gradient, orthogonal.item());
  auto a = n::plot_tensor_map(n::select(transform, 0, 0), -.2, 1.2),
       b = n::plot_tensor_map(n::select(gradient, 0, 0), -n::max(n::abs(gradient)).item(),
                              n::max(n::abs(gradient)).item());
  a.title("Declared nonorthogonal transform").x_label("matrix column").y_label("matrix row");
  b.title("Every penalty matrix-entry adjoint").x_label("matrix column").y_label("matrix row");
  auto layout = dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2);
  layout.add(a).add(b).size(1100, 500).fit_panels().save_svg(
      "build/point_models_checks_penalty.svg");
}
```
